Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:20:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Dump: route adapter, DumpPage and DumpPageContext

The Dump page moves onto the standard page structure. The route reads the
feed and its count and shapes them with the pure adapter toDumpPageProps
(utils/dump.ts, unit-tested) before rendering DumpPage, the renamed
DumpScreen. DumpPage provides DumpPageContext (capture, captureError,
loadMore): DumpComposer takes no props and DumpFeed no longer takes
onLoadMore. The Design Console's two Dump tabs run their fixtures through
the same adapter.

